@page "/api-reference"

<PageTitle>API Reference</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Version 1</p>
    <h1>API Reference</h1>
    <p>A concise reference for the HTTP endpoints demonstrated by this POC.</p>
</section>

<section class="panel">
    <p class="eyebrow">Member operations</p>
    <h2>Members</h2>
    <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table class="api-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Purpose</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td><span class="http-method">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/v1/members</code></td><td>List all members and their current status.</td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="http-method">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/v1/members/{memberId}/check-ins</code></td><td>List a member's check-in history.</td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="http-method">POST</span></td><td><code>/api/v1/members/{memberId}/check-ins</code></td><td>Check in an active member.</td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="http-method">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/v1/members/{memberId}/classes</code></td><td>List classes registered by a member.</td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="http-method">POST</span></td><td><code>/api/v1/members/{memberId}/documents</code></td><td>Upload a member document as multipart form data.</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="panel reference-note">
    <p class="eyebrow">Class operations</p>
    <h2>Classes</h2>
    <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table class="api-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Purpose</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td><span class="http-method">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/v1/classes</code></td><td>List available fitness classes.</td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="http-method">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/v1/classes/registration-summary</code></td><td>Get registration totals for all classes.</td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="http-method">GET</span></td><td><code>/api/v1/classes/{classId}/members</code></td><td>List members registered for a class.</td></tr>
                <tr><td><span class="http-method">POST</span></td><td><code>/api/v1/classes/{classId}/registrations/{memberId}</code></td><td>Register an active member for a class.</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="two-column reference-note">
    <section class="panel">
        <h2>Testing the endpoints</h2>
        <p>Paste a <strong>GET</strong> URL into the browser address bar. Use the client forms, PowerShell, curl, or another API tool for <strong>POST</strong> requests.</p>
        <p class="muted">Failed actions return a stable error code and operation ID that can be correlated with API logs.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="panel">
        <h2>Seed identifiers</h2>
        <ul class="seed-list">
            <li>Active member: <code>11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111</code></li>
            <li>Inactive member: <code>22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222</code></li>
            <li>Morning Yoga: <code>aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa</code></li>
            <li>Strength Training: <code>bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb</code></li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</div>
